{
  "about": "docs/39: the blocks the build designer may use, with a colour for its picture (the average of the block's texture). Hand-kept. Every property named in kinds was checked against the block's states in the game's client jar and the mods' jars (2026-10-07). A block with no kind is a full block and takes no properties. Walls, fences and panes are written without their connections: the game sets those when it places a structure (to be seen on the server, docs/39 \"Not proven\"); leaves are always written persistent so they never decay.",
